  "id": "hardiness",
  "term": "hardiness",
  "definition": "Hardiness is a psychological quality that helps a person adapt to personal, social, and educational challenges. In this context, it is shaped by influences such as family, society, peers, and teachers, and can be strengthened through social support, coping skills, self-confidence, emotional regulation, and personal growth.",
